  "title": "Chocolate Chip Pumpkin Cookies",
  "description": "This quick, easy chocolate chip pumpkin cookie with walnuts recipe only takes 30 minutes to make. The cookies are moist, flavorful, and perfect for fall.",
  "authors": [
